  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a professional nails and beauty salon. Ask about the service, nail condition, any allergies, and whether it is for an event. Ask about lash/brow history, patch tests, and skin sensitivities. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed in salon. Do not promise a specific result without consultation.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much are gel nails?",
      "a": "{price_note} Gel pricing depends on the service and nail length. We confirm the total with you in the salon.",
      "keywords": "cost,price,gel",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do acrylics?",
      "a": "Yes, we do acrylic and gel extensions. Tell us the length and shape you want so we can quote the full set.",
      "keywords": "acrylic,gel,extensions",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do infills?",
      "a": "Yes, we do infills and rebalances. Book your infill on time to keep the set in good condition.",
      "keywords": "infill,rebalance",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do SNS?",
      "a": "Yes, we do SNS and dip powder nails. Ask us about the finishes and colours available when you book.",
      "keywords": "sns,dip powder",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you remove gel or acrylic?",
      "a": "Yes, we do gel and acrylic removals. A removal fee applies, and we confirm it when you book.",
      "keywords": "removal,remove",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do nail art?",
      "a": "Yes, we do nail art and custom designs. Nail art is charged per nail, so bring a photo of the design you want.",
      "keywords": "nail art,design",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do lash extensions?",
      "a": "Yes, we do classic, hybrid, and volume lash extensions. Tell us the look you want so we can match the set to your natural lashes.",
      "keywords": "lash,extensions",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do lash lifts?",
      "a": "Yes, we do lash lifts and lash tints. Please tell us about any eye conditions or allergies before the treatment.",
      "keywords": "lash lift,tint",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you wax?",
      "a": "Yes, we do waxing for the face and body. Waxing is charged per area, and we confirm the areas when you book.",
      "keywords": "wax,waxing",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do eyebrows?",
      "a": "Yes, we shape, tint, and laminate brows. Please tell us about any brow allergies or recent treatments when you book.",
      "keywords": "brow,eyebrow",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do spray tans?",
      "a": "Yes, we do spray tans. Please tell us about any skin conditions or allergies before the appointment.",
      "keywords": "spray tan",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do facials?",
      "a": "Yes, we do facials and skin treatments. Tell us about your skin type and concerns so we can choose the right treatment.",
      "keywords": "facial,skin",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you require a patch test?",
      "a": "Yes, tinting and lash services require a patch test 24–48 hours before. Please tell us about any allergies when you book.",
      "keywords": "patch test,allergy",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "How long do lashes last?",
      "a": "Classic lashes usually last about two to three weeks before they need an infill. Results depend on your natural lash growth.",
      "keywords": "how long,lashes,last",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do I need to book?",
      "a": "Yes, booking is recommended. Walk-ins are subject to availability.",
      "keywords": "book,booking",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do bridal or event packages?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer bridal and event packages. Tell us the number of people and the date so we can quote a package.",
      "keywords": "bridal,event,package",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer gift vouchers?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer gift vouchers. Please contact us to confirm the amounts and how long they are valid.",
      "keywords": "voucher,gift",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "What if I don't like the result?",
      "a": "{guarantee_note} Please let us know within [number] hours if you are unhappy with the result, so we can talk through the options.",
      "keywords": "guarantee,satisfaction",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Are you insured?",
      "a": "We hold [your insurance type] cover through [your insurer]. A certificate is available on request.",
      "keywords": "insured,insurance",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you have a cancellation policy?",
      "a": "Cancelling with less than {cancellation_notice} may incur a fee. Please let us know as early as you can if your plans change.",
      "keywords": "cancel,cancellation",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do mobile nails?",
      "a": "Mobile service is available in [your service area]. Ask us to confirm your suburb and any travel fee before you book.",
      "keywords": "mobile,area",
      "priority": 7
    }
  ],
